    "created_at": "2017-04-24T15:52:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-24T15:52:55Z",
    "body": "I am torn on whether we should have a constructor or not, since this is an event people should not be using, and I don't really see why we should make work for four engines for no real reason.\r\n\r\nIf we have a constructor out of some desire for uniformity, then we must not break the pattern of other constructors by omitting `returnValue`, as that defeats the point of having uniform constructors everywhere.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
