    "created_at": "2017-04-24T17:35:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-24T17:35:52Z",
    "body": "I guess it makes no difference to me, but why do we have constructors (or createEvent) for any event type?  Is there normally any point in authors creating them?",
