    "updated_at": "2017-04-24T18:04:41Z",
    "body": "What's wrong with beforeunload?  It seems like it has legitimate uses to prevent accidentally browsing away from a page that's in the middle of work -- e.g., Gmail with an unsaved draft, or an IRC client.",
