    "created_at": "2017-04-25T10:46:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-25T10:46:21Z",
    "body": "So if we don't want to force all implementers to add a constructor here, why did we add constructors to old event types in the first place?  If we did it for other event types, why not this one too?  Even if we don't like this event type (and I don't see why we don't), why does that change anything?",
